- add GET /holdings/:owner: resolves a wallet's Collector Crypt cards
  (Metaplex Core collection CCryptUfeFSZ3Fgc9FLeKrhLVAP67FSqi1GuVoj9CRac)
  and the 11 NFT underlyings (real verified collections) back to catalog
  markets via Helius DAS. Uses DAS_RPC_URL (mainnet) decoupled from the
  market RPC.
- devLaunch: resolve admin + oracle keys env-first (ADMIN_KEYPAIR /
  ORACLE_KEYPAIR) via resolveSecretKey, with a clear "signer not
  configured" error instead of an ENOENT crash on the read-only box.
  Fixes token creation failing on the hosted indexer.
- annotate catalog: 44 cards get ccVaulted counts + ccCollection; 11 NFT
  collections get real verifiedCollection addresses (were synthetic hashes).

